---
<Base title="Personal Projects | Peace Ayegba"><header class="inner-banner"><div class="container inner-banner-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">Selected work</div><h1>Personal Projects</h1></div><p>Some of the algorithms and machine learning projects I've worked on.</p></div></header><main class="container inner-main"><div class="projects-grid">{projects.map(project=><article class="project-card"><div class="eyebrow">{project.tag}</div><h3>{project.title}</h3><p>{project.description}</p><a href={project.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{project.label} ↗</a></article>)}</div></main></Base>
